  "title": "Tofu Chocolate Cake",
  "description": "A creamy, rich chocolate cake that can be adapted for vegans by using margarine instead of butter. Do not use the silken tofu for this recipe, as it is too watery, and the cake will not set.",
  "authors": [
    "Christina"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-04T23:57:19-05:00",
